SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnn() and ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnnpp() functions conform to IEEE Std
     1003.1-2001 (“POSIX.1”), except that they ignore all errors from cclloossee().
     A future update of the Standard is expected to require that these func‐
     tions not fail because a file descriptor to be closed (via
     ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnn__ffiillee__aaccttiioonnss__aaddddcclloossee()) is not open.

